1
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:05,500
What are you looking at?
你們在看什麼？

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:09,760
A poster for that WWI movie I'm in. Check it out.
我演的一次大戰電影海報 你看

3
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:12,600
Wow! It looks really violent!
看起來真的好暴力

4
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:15,210
I know. I'm coming soon to a theater near you.
我知道 我即將在各大戲院露面

5
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,010
I'm in THX. I'm unsuitable for children!
我用的是THX系統 我不適合孩子們觀看

6
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:23,620
-I cannot wait to see this. -It's generating Oscar buzz.
-我等不及要看這個 -它有拿下奧斯卡金像獎的希望

7
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:27,150
-I started that! -I thought I did!
-是我開始的 -我以為是我

8
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,450
I just talked to my agent..
我剛剛跟經紀人談過…

9
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:33,630
and the premiere is next week and you're all invited!
下星期有首映會 你們通通被邀請了

10
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:35,820
-Will we take a limo? -Sure!
-我們要坐加長禮車嗎？ -當然

11
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:39,960
I love taking limos when nobody died.
我喜歡在非葬禮的時候 搭加長禮車

12
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:42,330
Well, I won't be able to come.
我沒辦法去

13
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:46,840
For those who haven't checked their calendars, today's my due date.
那些還沒查過日曆的人聽好了 今天是我的預產期

14
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:49,570
You should come. Maybe you'll have the baby in the limo.
你應該來的 或許你會在加長禮車上生孩子

15
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:53,510
That way for the first few moments of her life, she'll think we're really fancy.
那樣她的人生第一刻看到我們 會覺得我們都很棒

16
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:59,320
I want to thank you guys for how great you've been during this.
我要謝謝你們 一直很支持我

17
00:00:59,490 --> 00:01:03,750
I couldn't have done it without you. I loved these last 9 months.
沒有你們我絕對辦不到 我很喜歡過去的九個月

18
00:01:03,930 --> 00:01:06,220
I'm looking forward to the next part..
我很期待下一個階段…

19
00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:09,150
I am really gonna miss being pregnant.
我會很懷念懷孕的感覺

20
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:17,370
That's right. Still no baby.
沒錯，我還是沒生

21
00:01:18,770 --> 00:01:21,330
What's the matter? Is the puffy, sweaty pregnant lady..
怎麼了？ 汗臭味十足的臃腫孕婦…

22
00:01:21,510 --> 00:01:23,600
disturbing your precious coffee time?
打擾了你們寶貴的咖啡時間？

23
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:27,580
Come on, people, make some room.
大家快讓開

24
00:01:27,750 --> 00:01:31,580
Sweetie, maybe you'd be more comfortable here.
或許你坐在這裡 會比較舒服

25
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:34,510
You.
你

26
00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:40,160
Like you haven't done enough.
你似乎做的還不夠多

27
00:01:41,330 --> 00:01:45,630
I know you're miserable. I wish there was something I could do.
我知道你很難過 我真的希望能幫上忙

28
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:49,240
I wish I were a sea horse.
我希望我是海馬

29
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:55,840
Because with sea horses, it's the male. They carry the babies.
因為是公海馬 負責孵育小寶寶

30
00:01:58,550 --> 00:02:02,310
And then also, I'd be far away in the sea.
而且，我可以逃到海裡

31
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:16,490
God.
天啊

32
00:02:17,130 --> 00:02:22,400
I have never been so uncomfortable in my entire life.
我這輩子 從來沒有這麼難受過

33
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:25,000
I know. I remember toward the end..
我瞭解，我記得…

34
00:02:25,210 --> 00:02:30,270
That's a great story. Tell it while you're getting me some iced tea.
那是個很棒的故事 幫我拿冰茶來再說

35
00:02:33,050 --> 00:02:37,210
Oh, God, get out! Get out, get out, get out!
天啊，滾出來，滾出來，滾出來

36
00:02:39,220 --> 00:02:40,620
Let's.
走吧

37
00:02:43,029 --> 00:02:45,156
The One Where Rachel Is Late
本集播出：遲來的寶寶


00:02:46,029 --> 00:02:47,156
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

38
00:03:22,230 --> 00:03:25,200
Hey, did you have the baby yet?
你的寶寶生了嗎？

39
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:31,000
Do you want me to sit on you? Because I'll do it.
你要我坐在你身上嗎？ 因為我真的會那麼做

40
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:35,230
-What are you doing here? -They sent me home from work.
-你在這裡做什麼？ -公司要我回家

41
00:03:35,410 --> 00:03:38,900
They said, "Start your maternity leave now. Just rest."
他們說「開始休產假 回家去休息吧」

42
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:41,070
You know what? Screw them!
你知道嗎？去他們的

43
00:03:41,250 --> 00:03:45,120
If they don't want me there, I'll hang out with you guys.
如果他們不要我待在那裡 我可以跟你們鬼混

44
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:49,490
Or you could do volunteer work.
或許你可以去做義工

45
00:03:50,990 --> 00:03:53,690
-Hello? -Joey, it's Estelle.
-哈囉 -喬伊，我是雅詩黛

46
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:58,990
I was able to get you and one guest tickets to your premiere.
我幫你跟你的一個朋友 弄到首映會的門票

47
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:04,000
-You told me I could have six tickets. -I sold four on eBay.
-你說我可以拿六張票 -我把四張拿去網站拍賣了

48
00:04:06,170 --> 00:04:08,970
You'll be sitting next to HotGuy 372.
你得坐在帥哥372旁邊

49
00:04:10,650 --> 00:04:13,880
So that's it? I only get to bring one guest?
就那樣？ 我只能帶一個朋友去？

50
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:18,280
Yeah. What time you wanna pick me up?
對 你什麼時候來接我？

51
00:04:18,690 --> 00:04:20,350
Hello?
喂？

52
00:04:21,190 --> 00:04:24,630
You hear that? I only get one extra ticket to my premiere.
你們聽到了嗎？ 我只能帶一個朋友參加首映會

53
00:04:24,830 --> 00:04:29,130
So somehow I have to pick between you three and Ross.
所以我得在你們三個 跟羅斯之間做挑選

54
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:34,360
-What about me? -You said you didn't want to go.
-我呢？ -你說過你不想去

55
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:37,500
I don't. But I would still like to be acknowledged.
沒錯 但我還是希望有被重視的感覺

56
00:04:37,740 --> 00:04:42,680
-Because I'm pregnant, I'm invisible? -Definitely not invisible.
-我懷孕了就變成隱形人？ -你絕不是隱形人

57
00:04:44,850 --> 00:04:48,540
Ross didn't care enough to be here, so he's out.
羅斯根本不在這裡 所以他出局了

58
00:04:48,820 --> 00:04:52,620
-You snooze, you lose. -He's not snoozing. He's teaching.
-你打瞌睡你就輸了 -他沒有打瞌睡，他在教書

59
00:04:52,820 --> 00:04:55,080
Well, then somebody's snoozing.
那麼一定有人在打瞌睡

60
00:04:55,260 --> 00:05:00,630
And, Joey, not that this should affect you at all, but if you pick me..
喬伊，我不是要你聽我的 但如果你選了我…

61
00:05:00,830 --> 00:05:06,530
I was planning on wearing a sequin dress cut down to here.
我計劃穿露到這裡的 緊身洋裝

62
00:05:07,570 --> 00:05:10,260
-I haven't seen this dress. -Star in a movie.
-我還沒有看過這套洋裝 -我可以當電影明星

63
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:17,010
Pick whoever you want. Listen to your heart. What does it tell you?
你想挑誰都可以，聽你的心說話 它跟你說了什麼？

64
00:05:17,180 --> 00:05:19,200
Phoebe. Phoebe. Phoebe.
菲比…

65
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:23,450
Well..
這個嘛…

66
00:05:26,090 --> 00:05:28,560
I think I want to take Chandler.
我想我要挑錢德

67
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:31,520
Phoebe, Phoebe, Phoebe.
菲比…

68
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:38,160
-You want to take me? -Yeah, I wish I could take everybody.
-你要挑我？ -對，我希望能帶大家去

69
00:05:38,370 --> 00:05:41,360
But Chandler's always supported my career.
但錢德一直都很支持我的事業

70
00:05:41,540 --> 00:05:45,030
He's paid for acting classes, headshots and stuff.
他幫我付表演課 跟沙龍照等等的費用

71
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:47,970
This will be my way of paying you back.
這就是我回報你的方式

72
00:05:48,180 --> 00:05:52,310
So you're never actually going to pay me back?
所以你打算不還我錢？

73
00:05:53,780 --> 00:05:58,080
Just because he paid for your headshots, you're gonna take him?
只因為他幫你付沙龍照的錢 你就要選他？

74
00:05:58,250 --> 00:06:03,380
I don't think you're comprehending just how slutty this dress is.
我想你不瞭解那件洋裝有多露

75
00:06:04,230 --> 00:06:08,820
It's not just the stuff he paid for. It's everything, you know?
不光只因為他付了錢 他真的很支持我，你們知道嗎？

76
00:06:09,100 --> 00:06:13,120
He read lines with me. He went with me on auditions when I was nervous.
他跟我對台詞 我很緊張時陪我去試鏡

77
00:06:13,430 --> 00:06:16,630
Then he consoled me after I didn't get parts that I wanted.
當我沒拿到我要的角色時 他會安慰我

78
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:20,430
You always believed in me, man, even when I didn't.
你一直相信我 即使連我都不相信自己

79
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:24,810
I always knew you were gonna make it. I'm so proud of you.
我一直都知道你會成功 我非常以你為榮

80
00:06:24,980 --> 00:06:28,180
Thanks, that means a lot to me.
謝謝，那對我來說很重要

81
00:06:31,420 --> 00:06:35,480
Mon, maybe one of these guys wants to wear your dress.
摩妮卡，或許他們之中 有人想穿你的洋裝

82
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:41,090
-I'm gonna go shave. -Yeah, well, I'm gonna go spit.
-我得去刮鬍子 -對，我得去吐痰了

83
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,590
I have to pee.
我得去尿尿了

84
00:06:47,770 --> 00:06:53,110
If I don't come out, it's because I've choked to death on the potpourri stink.
五分鐘後如果我沒出來 那是因為我被花香味薰死了

85
00:06:54,680 --> 00:07:00,940
You hold her nose, I'll blow in her mouth and the kid'll just.. out of her.
等她出來時你捏住她的鼻子 我對她的嘴巴吹氣，寶寶就會掉出來

86
00:07:02,550 --> 00:07:05,780
She's a week late. She's got to have it today.
她晚了一個星期 今天她一定會生

87
00:07:05,950 --> 00:07:10,360
I don't know. I think it's still gonna be a while.
我不知道 我想應該還要一陣子

88
00:07:10,630 --> 00:07:13,060
Care to make it interesting?
你想加點刺激嗎？

89
00:07:13,290 --> 00:07:16,700
-I bet you she'll have it tomorrow. -You're on.
-我跟你賭她明天會生 -沒問題

90
00:07:16,900 --> 00:07:20,490
-Okay, how much? -One hundred thousand dollars.
-好吧，賭多少？ -10萬

91
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:26,860
-How about 50 bucks? -I'll call Zurich and move some money.
-50塊如何？ -我會打電話到蘇黎世請他們匯錢來

92
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:30,570
All right, whose turn is it to help me get up?
好了，這次輪到誰來扶我？

93
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:33,680
No one's here.
沒有人在

94
00:07:36,220 --> 00:07:38,520
Oh, damn it!
該死

95
00:07:42,061 --> 00:07:43,926
《在那邊》 （世界首映會）

96
00:07:51,570 --> 00:07:56,730
This is exciting. So glamorous! People taking our picture. How do I look?
這真的是太刺激了，太棒了 好多人幫我們拍照，我看起來如何？

97
00:07:57,210 --> 00:07:59,900
-A little tall. -What?
-太高了一點 -什麼？

98
00:08:00,140 --> 00:08:04,370
Would you crouch down a bit so that I look taller?
你能不能蹲低一點 讓我看起來高一點？

99
00:08:05,580 --> 00:08:07,910
There you go.
這樣好

100
00:08:09,550 --> 00:08:12,280
It's just so glamorous.
真的是太棒了

101
00:08:15,790 --> 00:08:18,730
Oh, hey, Mon? Rach is here.
摩妮卡，瑞秋來了

102
00:08:18,930 --> 00:08:21,830
And you're still pregnant.
你還沒生

103
00:08:22,060 --> 00:08:25,090
I'm sorry. I know how uncomfortable you are.
真對不起 我知道你很不舒服

104
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:30,290
You know what? You look great. Yeah, like 50 bucks.
你知道嗎？你看起來棒極了 就跟50塊鈔票一樣

105
00:08:31,940 --> 00:08:37,810
I have to go pee. Apparently this baby thinks my bladder is a squeeze toy.
我得去尿尿，很明顯地這個寶寶 把我的膀胱當成玩具捏

106
00:08:39,650 --> 00:08:43,240
Damn it. Here's your 50 bucks.
該死，50塊拿去

107
00:08:43,620 --> 00:08:48,650
That's interesting that you lost. Now, I forget, do you like to lose?
你會輸真的是太有趣了 我忘了，你喜歡輸嗎？

108
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:51,050
All right, stop it.
好吧，別說了

109
00:08:51,290 --> 00:08:54,460
-Double or nothing she has it tomorrow. -Fine.
-我們加倍來賭她明天會生 -好吧

110
00:08:54,660 --> 00:09:00,430
Until then, General Grant, why don't you set up camp.. right there?
在那之前，葛蘭特將軍 你為什麼不在這裡…紮營？

111
00:09:01,570 --> 00:09:05,200
-Rachel here? We have an appointment. -In the bathroom.
-瑞秋在這裡嗎？我們得去看醫生 -在廁所裡

112
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:08,670
-Rach, we gotta go. -In a minute!
-瑞秋，我們得走了 -馬上好

113
00:09:10,810 --> 00:09:16,180
People ask why we're not together. I just don't know what to tell them.
大家問我們為什麼不在一起 我不知道該怎麼告訴他們

114
00:09:16,380 --> 00:09:17,820
All right, let's go.
好吧，我們該走了

115
00:09:19,290 --> 00:09:21,260
Oh, wait a minute.
等一下

116
00:09:21,420 --> 00:09:23,120
Do I have to pee again?
我又得尿尿嗎？

117
00:09:23,290 --> 00:09:25,380
No, I'm good.
不，我沒事

118
00:09:25,560 --> 00:09:27,890
Do you want to go change first?
你要不要先去換衣服？

119
00:09:28,100 --> 00:09:32,000
The doctor's staying open late for us, but if you hurry..
醫生會等我們 但如果你快一點…

120
00:09:33,330 --> 00:09:36,900
-No, I'm fine. -You don't think that's inappropriate?
-不，我很好 -你不覺那套衣服很不適當嗎？

121
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:40,800
-What? -Good God, man. Don't anger it.
-什麼？ -天啊，別火上加油

122
00:09:44,410 --> 00:09:50,320
Ross, it is 100 degrees outside. For the first time in weeks, I am..
羅斯，外面有一百度 這是好幾個星期以來我第一次…

123
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:54,150
Fine. Whatever you want. You're the mommy.
好吧，隨便你 你是媽咪

124
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:56,310
No! Don't call me "Mommy."
不，別叫我「媽咪」

125
00:09:56,560 --> 00:10:00,360
It's bad enough you call your own mother that.
你那樣叫你媽就已經夠糟了

126
00:10:01,030 --> 00:10:03,430
I'm actually with her on this one.
這一次我同意她的說法

127
00:10:03,900 --> 00:10:07,100
Come on, Ross. We're gonna be late.
快點，羅斯 我們要遲到了

128
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:11,030
Either of you want to be Ross?
你們想不想當羅斯？

129
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:21,740
I thought I knew who the enemy was, but it was you.
我以為我知道敵人是誰 但敵人卻是你

130
00:10:21,980 --> 00:10:26,480
Okay, this is it. This is my big fight scene coming up.
好吧 我的打鬥戲要開始了

131
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:30,720
I'm fighting for every man in the 82nd Ground Division.
我要打倒 82地面師的每個人

132
00:10:39,330 --> 00:10:42,890
Ross? Can I ask you something?
羅斯 我能問你一件事嗎？

133
00:10:43,140 --> 00:10:47,130
When Carol was pregnant with Ben..
卡蘿懷班的時候…

134
00:10:47,640 --> 00:10:50,340
were you this irritating?
你有這麼暴躁嗎？

135
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:56,080
-Excuse me? -Nothing. You're just..
-你說什麼？ -沒事，你只是…

136
00:10:56,250 --> 00:11:01,520
You've been a little short with me lately. I'm not trying to irritate you.
你最近對我很不耐煩 我不想惹毛你

137
00:11:01,690 --> 00:11:05,680
Well, then, you must have a natural talent for it.
那麼你一定是有惹毛我的天份

138
00:11:05,930 --> 00:11:10,490
The doctor will be in soon. Why don't we not speak until then?
醫生馬上到 在那之前我們還是別說話

139
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:12,000
Okay.
好吧

140
00:11:16,370 --> 00:11:19,700
Seriously. Breathe louder, Ross. That's great.
說真的，呼吸大聲一點，羅斯 那真的太棒了

141
00:11:22,980 --> 00:11:26,110
We should ask the doctor if she even knows..
我們應該問醫生 她知不知道…

142
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:31,740
how to deliver a baby that's half human, half pure evil!
怎麼接生半人半惡魔的孩子

143
00:11:34,220 --> 00:11:37,280
-Hi, Dr. Long. How are you? -You're nice to her.
-朗醫生，你好嗎？ -你對她很好

144
00:11:37,490 --> 00:11:40,460
She has the drugs.
她有藥

145
00:11:41,430 --> 00:11:43,760
We'll do a quick check.
-我很快幫你檢查一下 -好的

146
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:47,760
Eight days late, huh? You must be getting uncomfortable.
已經遲了八天嗎？ 你一定會很不舒服

147
00:11:47,940 --> 00:11:50,500
Yeah, just a tad.
對，只有一點

148
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:56,430
You're 80% effaced. You're on your way. It still could last a while.
